    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21387" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γάδειρα</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ων</span>, τά</span>,
			<u>Cadiz</u>, <i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>N.</u>
			4.69
		</span></i>, etc.; 
			Ion.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γήδειρα</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			4.8
		</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γᾰδειρίτης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γᾰδειρεύς</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a man of Cadiz</i>, <i><span class="en">
				St.Byz.
			</span></i>:—Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γᾰδειρικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, τάριχος</span>”
