				Plu.
				<u>Sert.</u>
				8
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γᾰδειρόθεν</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				14.121
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Metrod.
			</span></i>), Euthyd. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.116c
			</span></i>.</div>
